  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Persona Writer Studio**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the \"Persona Writer Studio\" application, leveraging the user\'s provided image and HTML snippet. My priority is a complete and polished implementation. I\'m moving toward an intuitive and functional design for the application. The goal is to create a seamless user experience.\n\n\n**Analyzing Tech Stack & Libraries**\n\nI\'ve been reviewing the technology stack and available libraries. `firebase-integration` seems very relevant for user authentication, text saving, and archiving, especially if the user requires robust backend functionality. The `gemini-api` is critical, enabling real-time AI-powered text generation based on the persona. It significantly enhances the application\'s value, which is very exciting. The `image-generation` skill may provide optional UI enhancements, and can be considered for future feature implementation.\n\n\n**Evaluating Gemini API Usage**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on integrating the `gemini-api`, seeing that `/skills/system_skills/gemini_api/SKILL.md` is relevant. The `metadata.json` showing `MAJOR_CAPABILITY_SERVER_SIDE_GEMINI_API` makes me think I should create a server-side Gemini API route, allowing for text generation and style assessments. I also see three UI screens from the user\'s image: an Evaluation Dashboard (dark theme) for comparing outputs, a Manuscript Archive (light theme) for project management, and a light-themed main Landing Page.\n\n\n**Prioritizing UI Editor Integration**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the Editor screen. I\'ll need to implement elements for \"Casting Your Perfect AI Persona,\" \"Start Writing,\" and \"Explore Personas.\" The Editor itself, with its light theme, requires components for director prompts, manuscript content, a right-side guide (style, tone, LoRA parameters), and a bottom writing bar. I\'m keen on integrating the `gemini-api` and considering Firebase for potential manuscript storage, archiving, and retrieval, turning this into a more robust full-stack application. I\'ll weigh the pros and cons of Firebase against local storage, keeping the \"Storage & Persistence\" guidelines in mind.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 6
      nanos: 603532835
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
