    user_response: "Apply the \"Editorial Aesthetic\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Editorial Aesthetic\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"w-[1024px] h-[768px] bg-[#0F0F0F] text-[#F5F5F5] font-sans overflow-hidden flex flex-col\\\">\\n  <!-- Top Navigation Rail -->\\n  <nav class=\\\"h-16 w-full border-b border-[#2A2A2A] flex items-center justify-between px-10 z-20\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-8\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase opacity-60\\\">The Archive</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase\\\">Index</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase opacity-60\\\">Library</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase opacity-60\\\">Search</span>\\n      <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-[#2A2A2A] flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-white rounded-full\\\"></div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </nav>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"flex-1 flex overflow-hidden\\\">\\n    <!-- Side Meta Rail -->\\n    <aside class=\\\"w-24 border-r border-[#2A2A2A] flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-10\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"rotate-[-90deg] whitespace-nowrap text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.5em] uppercase opacity-40 origin-center\\\">\\n        Issue No. 08 // Autumn Winter 2024\\n      </div>\\n    </aside>\\n\\n    <!-- Primary Content Area -->\\n    <section class=\\\"flex-1 flex flex-col p-12\\\">\\n      <!-- Hero Section -->\\n      <div class=\\\"relative flex-1 flex flex-col justify-end\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-1/2 h-full opacity-20\\\">\\n          <!-- Abstract Geometric Background Element -->\\n          <div class=\\\"w-full h-full border-l border-t border-[#3A3A3A] relative\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"absolute bottom-10 left-10 w-full h-[1px] bg-[#3A3A3A]\\\"></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <header class=\\\"relative z-10\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6 text-[#A0A0A0] font-semibold\\\">\\n            Featured Monograph / Architecture\\n          </p>\\n          <h1 class=\\\"text-[140px] leading-[0.82] font-serif italic tracking-tighter mb-8\\\">\\n            Silent<br/>Spaces\\n          </h1>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-start gap-12 max-w-2xl\\\">\\n            <p class=\\\"text-lg font-light leading-relaxed opacity-80\\\">\\n              An exploration of minimalist voids and the psychology of structural stillness in contemporary urban landscapes.\\n            </p>\\n            <button class=\\\"mt-2 px-8 py-4 border border-white text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] font-bold hover:bg-white hover:text-black transition-colors\\\">\\n              Read Article\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n        </header>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <!-- Secondary Grid Section -->\\n      <div class=\\\"mt-16 grid grid-cols-3 gap-12 border-t border-[#2A2A2A] pt-12\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-bold opacity-40\\\">01 / Contrast</p>\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xl font-serif italic uppercase tracking-wider\\\">Shadow Play</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-xs leading-relaxed opacity-60 font-light\\\">\\n            Understanding how light dictates form and function in subterranean dwellings.\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-bold opacity-40\\\">02 / Material</p>\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xl font-serif italic uppercase tracking-wider\\\">Concrete Skin</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-xs leading-relaxed opacity-60 font-light\\\">\\n            The brutalist revival through the lens of modern tactile sustainability.\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-bold opacity-40\\\">03 / Theory</p>\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xl font-serif italic uppercase tracking-wider\\\">The Void</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-xs leading-relaxed opacity-60 font-light\\\">\\n            Why the most important part of any structure is the space left entirely empty.\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- Right Image Strip -->\\n    <aside class=\\\"w-[300px] bg-[#1A1A1A] relative flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden\\\">\\n      <!-- Placeholder for a high-concept image -->\\n      <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex-1 bg-[#151515] border-b border-[#2A2A2A]\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex-1 bg-[#1A1A1A]\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex-1 bg-[#202020]\\\"></div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"relative z-10 p-10\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-full aspect-[3/4] border border-[#3A3A3A] bg-[#0A0A0A] flex flex-col p-6\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex-1 bg-[#111] border border-[#222]\\\"></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"mt-4 flex justify-between items-center\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest opacity-40 italic\\\">Fig. 12</span>\\n            <div class=\\\"w-6 h-[1px] bg-white opacity-20\\\"></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </aside>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <!-- Footer Bar -->\\n  <footer class=\\\"h-20 w-full border-t border-[#2A2A2A] flex items-center justify-between px-10\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-12\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"opacity-40 mr-2\\\">Page</span> 042 / 128\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"opacity-40 mr-2\\\">Time</span> 14:24 GMT\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex gap-6 items-center\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-10 h-1 bg-white\\\"></div>\\n      <div class=\\\"w-20 h-[1px] bg-white opacity-20\\\"></div>\\n      <div class=\\\"w-20 h-[1px] bg-white opacity-20\\\"></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n\\n  <style>\\n    @import url(\'https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;1,400;1,700&display=swap\');\\n    .font-serif {\\n      font-family: \'Playfair Display\', Georgia, serif;\\n    }\\n    body {\\n      background-color: #0F0F0F;\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Editorial Aesthetic\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Editorial Aesthetic\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"w-[1024px] h-[768px] bg-[#0F0F0F] text-[#F5F5F5] font-sans overflow-hidden flex flex-col\\\">\\n  <!-- Top Navigation Rail -->\\n  <nav class=\\\"h-16 w-full border-b border-[#2A2A2A] flex items-center justify-between px-10 z-20\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-8\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase opacity-60\\\">The Archive</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase\\\">Index</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase opacity-60\\\">Library</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase opacity-60\\\">Search</span>\\n      <div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-[#2A2A2A] flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-white rounded-full\\\"></div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </nav>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"flex-1 flex overflow-hidden\\\">\\n    <!-- Side Meta Rail -->\\n    <aside class=\\\"w-24 border-r border-[#2A2A2A] flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-10\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"rotate-[-90deg] whitespace-nowrap text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.5em] uppercase opacity-40 origin-center\\\">\\n        Issue No. 08 // Autumn Winter 2024\\n      </div>\\n    </aside>\\n\\n    <!-- Primary Content Area -->\\n    <section class=\\\"flex-1 flex flex-col p-12\\\">\\n      <!-- Hero Section -->\\n      <div class=\\\"relative flex-1 flex flex-col justify-end\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-1/2 h-full opacity-20\\\">\\n          <!-- Abstract Geometric Background Element -->\\n          <div class=\\\"w-full h-full border-l border-t border-[#3A3A3A] relative\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"absolute bottom-10 left-10 w-full h-[1px] bg-[#3A3A3A]\\\"></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <header class=\\\"relative z-10\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-6 text-[#A0A0A0] font-semibold\\\">\\n            Featured Monograph / Architecture\\n          </p>\\n          <h1 class=\\\"text-[140px] leading-[0.82] font-serif italic tracking-tighter mb-8\\\">\\n            Silent<br/>Spaces\\n          </h1>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-start gap-12 max-w-2xl\\\">\\n            <p class=\\\"text-lg font-light leading-relaxed opacity-80\\\">\\n              An exploration of minimalist voids and the psychology of structural stillness in contemporary urban landscapes.\\n            </p>\\n            <button class=\\\"mt-2 px-8 py-4 border border-white text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] font-bold hover:bg-white hover:text-black transition-colors\\\">\\n              Read Article\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n        </header>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <!-- Secondary Grid Section -->\\n      <div class=\\\"mt-16 grid grid-cols-3 gap-12 border-t border-[#2A2A2A] pt-12\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-bold opacity-40\\\">01 / Contrast</p>\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xl font-serif italic uppercase tracking-wider\\\">Shadow Play</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-xs leading-relaxed opacity-60 font-light\\\">\\n            Understanding how light dictates form and function in subterranean dwellings.\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-bold opacity-40\\\">02 / Material</p>\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xl font-serif italic uppercase tracking-wider\\\">Concrete Skin</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-xs leading-relaxed opacity-60 font-light\\\">\\n            The brutalist revival through the lens of modern tactile sustainability.\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"space-y-4\\\">\\n          <p class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-bold opacity-40\\\">03 / Theory</p>\\n          <h3 class=\\\"text-xl font-serif italic uppercase tracking-wider\\\">The Void</h3>\\n          <p class=\\\"text-xs leading-relaxed opacity-60 font-light\\\">\\n            Why the most important part of any structure is the space left entirely empty.\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- Right Image Strip -->\\n    <aside class=\\\"w-[300px] bg-[#1A1A1A] relative flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden\\\">\\n      <!-- Placeholder for a high-concept image -->\\n      <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex-1 bg-[#151515] border-b border-[#2A2A2A]\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex-1 bg-[#1A1A1A]\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"flex-1 bg-[#202020]\\\"></div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"relative z-10 p-10\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-full aspect-[3/4] border border-[#3A3A3A] bg-[#0A0A0A] flex flex-col p-6\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex-1 bg-[#111] border border-[#222]\\\"></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"mt-4 flex justify-between items-center\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest opacity-40 italic\\\">Fig. 12</span>\\n            <div class=\\\"w-6 h-[1px] bg-white opacity-20\\\"></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </aside>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <!-- Footer Bar -->\\n  <footer class=\\\"h-20 w-full border-t border-[#2A2A2A] flex items-center justify-between px-10\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-12\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"opacity-40 mr-2\\\">Page</span> 042 / 128\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"opacity-40 mr-2\\\">Time</span> 14:24 GMT\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex gap-6 items-center\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-10 h-1 bg-white\\\"></div>\\n      <div class=\\\"w-20 h-[1px] bg-white opacity-20\\\"></div>\\n      <div class=\\\"w-20 h-[1px] bg-white opacity-20\\\"></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n\\n  <style>\\n    @import url(\'https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;1,400;1,700&display=swap\');\\n    .font-serif {\\n      font-family: \'Playfair Display\', Georgia, serif;\\n    }\\n    body {\\n      background-color: #0F0F0F;\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    }
